OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road closed after pedestrian
OL,4,Ahit by vehicle
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of Nottingham's ring road has been
OL,7,Fclosed after a pedestrian was hit by a
OL,8,Fvehicle in Wollaton.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said emergency
OL,11,Fservices were called to Western
OL,12,FBoulevard, near Wollaton Road, at about
OL,13,F17:05 GMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe force said a man had been injured
OL,16,Fand was taken to hospital.
OL,18,FRoad closures have now been put in
OL,19,Fplace on Western Boulevard northbound,
OL,20,Fbetween Crown Island and Beechdale
OL,21,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
